!archive/external_exports/.gitkeep
# Claude Code — commit project settings, ignore local overrides and worktrees
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
data/school/
# box-written artefacts must never be tracked (a tracked file the box writes
# dirties its tree and blocks the pre-task git pull — second audit 2026-09-02)
data/nap_record.csv
data/rulings_recalls.json
data/task_runs.log
data/model_usage.csv
data/*.db
data/school/yardstick/
data/school/yardstick.md
data/school/bar_backtest.md
data/school/why/

# THE RECORD EXPORT (audit 2026-09-21): the box rewrites these every night in
# trial.sh's settle. A TRACKED file the box rewrites is the same trap as the
# corpus filenames — the next time main changes one, the box's `git pull`
# conflicts and the daily run stops. They stay local until the box can push,
# at which point the box commits them and this exclusion is revisited.
data/record.csv
docs/THE_RECORD.md
